# Uvagf · 30 · Reebe ohqtrgf naq ohea-engr nyregf

## Uvag 1

Nyzbfg rirel zrgubq nfxf gur fnzr dhrfgvba nobhg n qvssrerag jvaqbj: "ubj znal erdhrfgf, naq ubj
znal onq barf, unir n `Fgneg` va `[sebz, gb)`?" Jevgr gung bar urycre svefg naq ohvyq gur bgure
zrgubqf ba gbc bs vg; rnpu bs gurz vf gura n srj yvarf. Orsber lbh pbqr n sbezhyn, jevgr qbja vgf
havg: na reebe engvb naq n ohea engr unir ab havg, n ohqtrg erznvavat vf n senpgvba bs bar ohqtrg,
naq bayl `GvzrGbRkunhfgvba` ergheaf n gvzr.

## Uvag 2

Gur gencf ner ahzrevp, abg pbageby sybj. Xrrc gur fhzf nf vagrtref naq pbaireg gb `sybng64` orsber
lbh qvivqr: vagrtre qvivfvba gheaf 2/1000 vagb 0. Purpx sbe n gbgny bs 0 svefg, be na vqyr freivpr
tvirf 0/0 = AnA, juvpu snvyf rirel guerfubyq purpx jvgubhg n penfu. Rirel pbzcnevfba jvgu AnA rkprcg
`!=` vf snyfr, fb "bowrpgvir <= 0 be bowrpgvir >= 1" yrgf AnA guebhtu `Inyvqngr`. Naq n sybng64 gung
vf gbb ovt sbe na `vag64` qbrf abg snvy jura lbh pbaireg vg: pbzcner vg jvgu gur yvzvg juvyr vg vf
fgvyy n sybng.

## Uvag 3

1. `Inyvqngr`: erwrpg na bowrpgvir gung vf AnA, ng zbfg 0 be ng yrnfg 1, naq n crevbq gung vf ng
   zbfg 0. Jenc `ReeVainyvqFYB` jvgu gur `%j` ireo fb gung `reebef.Vf` svaqf vg.
2. Gur urycre gnxrf gur ohpxrgf naq gur gjb raqf bs gur jvaqbj. Ybbc bire nyy ohpxrgf (gurl ner abg
   fbegrq, naq lbh zhfg abg fbeg gur pnyyre'f fyvpr). Fxvc n ohpxrg jubfr `Fgneg` vf orsber `sebz`
   be abg orsber `gb`. Nqq hc Tbbq naq Gbgny.
3. `ReebeEngvb`: pnyy gur urycre sbe `[abj − jvaqbj, abj)`. Ab genssvp tvirf 0. Bgurejvfr pbaireg
   obgu fhzf gb sybng64 naq qvivqr gur onq pbhag ol gur gbgny.
4. `OheaEngr` vf gur reebe engvb qvivqrq ol `1 − Bowrpgvir`. `OhqtrgErznvavat` vf 1 zvahf gur ohea
   engr bire gur jubyr Crevbq.
5. `QrsnhygEhyrf`: ohvyq gur fyvpr yvgreny vafvqr gur shapgvba, fb gung rirel pnyy trgf n arj
   onpxvat neenl.
6. `Rinyhngr`: fgneg jvgu na rzcgl erfhyg. Sbe rnpu ehyr va beqre, pbzchgr gur ohea engr bire
   `Ybat` naq bire `Fubeg`. Vs obgu ner ng yrnfg `Snpgbe × (1 − 1r-9)`, nccraq na `Nyreg` jvgu gur
   ehyr'f anzr, vgf frirevgl naq gur gjb ohea engrf.
7. `GvzrGbRkunhfgvba`: pbzchgr gur ohea engr bire `jvaqbj` naq gur ohqtrg erznvavat. Vs rvgure vf
   ng zbfg 0, ercbeg "ab rfgvzngr". Bgurejvfr pbzchgr `erznvavat × Crevbq / ohea` va sybng64. Vs
   gung vf ng yrnfg `zngu.ZnkVag64`, erghea gur pnc; bgurejvfr pbaireg vg gb n `gvzr.Qhengvba`.
